  "Each strategy skill ships a deterministic backtest run against a pinned synthetic sample dataset with a seeded generator. This panel serves the exact artifact those runs write: every skill’s PASS/FAIL, the dataset and code fingerprints, and one repository stable digest over them all. Open any skill to see its content hash, the one line command that regenerates it, the hashed source files and the backtest console. Clone the public repo, run the command and the hashes match · that is the proof the numbers are not hand typed.": "每个策略技能都附带一次确定性回测，针对一个固定的合成样本数据集和带种子的生成器运行。本面板提供这些运行写出的确切产物：每个技能的 PASS/FAIL、数据集与代码指纹，以及对它们整体的一个仓库稳定摘要。打开任意技能即可查看其内容哈希、可重新生成它的单行命令、被哈希的源文件以及回测控制台。克隆公共仓库、运行该命令，哈希即可吻合 · 这就是这些数字并非手工填写的证明。",
