  "The same flow behind every call: CoinMarketCap data converges into MEFAI's decision engine, executes through Trust Wallet and settles as proof on BNB Chain. Tap any node to open its dossier.": '每一次决策背后都是同一条流程：CoinMarketCap 数据汇入 MEFAI 的决策引擎，通过 Trust Wallet 执行，并在 BNB Chain 上作为证明结算。点击任一节点即可打开其详情。',
  'Every guarantee below is structural not a promise. You can audit each one yourself.': '下列每一项保证都是结构性的，而非口头承诺。你可以逐一亲自审计。',
  'Commit before reveal': '先承诺，后揭晓',
  'Each trade is committed as keccak(symbol direction entry target stop expiry salt) to the BSC registry before entry then revealed after. The track record cannot be backfilled by construction.': '每笔交易在入场前都以 keccak（标的 方向 入场 目标 止损 到期 盐值）的形式承诺到 BSC 注册表，之后再揭晓。其业绩记录在结构上无法被事后补填。',
  'Circuit breaker on the ledger': '账本上的熔断机制',
  'Empirical Kelly sizing': '基于经验的凯利仓位',
  'Win rate and optimal TP/SL come from real labeled outcomes not guesses. Size shrinks as the drawdown budget shrinks so the agent maximizes Sharpe while it physically cannot breach the cap.': '胜率与最优止盈/止损来自真实标注的结果，而非猜测。随着回撤预算缩小，仓位随之收缩，从而在物理上无法突破上限的同时使夏普比率最大化。',
  'Omni signal fusion': '全域信号融合',
  'One conviction score unions every MEFAI capability: signals, expert debate, whale tracking, smart money, accumulation, derivatives risk and the full CoinMarketCap regime, each weighted by its own hit rate.': '一个信念评分汇聚 MEFAI 的全部能力：信号、专家辩论、巨鲸追踪、聪明钱、吸筹、衍生品风险，以及完整的 CoinMarketCap 体系，每一项都按其自身命中率加权。',
  'Pre trade security gate': '交易前安全闸门',
  'Honeypot, contract scan, slippage, approval, preflight and MEV checks run before any spend. A GO or BLOCK verdict gates execution. Every spend is quote bounded and capped.': '蜜罐、合约扫描、滑点、授权、预检和 MEV 检查都会在任何花费之前运行。GO 或 BLOCK 的裁定决定是否执行。每笔花费都有报价边界并设有上限。',
