  'The verified signal feed is served over HTTP 402. Payment is bound with EIP-3009 to the exact token and chain charged so one agent can pay another for proven alpha without a human in the loop.': '已验证的信号数据源通过 HTTP 402 提供。付款通过 EIP-3009 绑定到所收取的确切代币与链，因此一个代理无需人工介入即可为已证实的 alpha 向另一个代理付费。',
