  'and a wallet that': '以及一个',
  'cannot be drained': '无法被掏空的钱包',
  'MEFAI never holds your keys. We use Trust Wallet for sign in identity and execution then wrap every move in a safety gate so the same retail users Trust Wallet onboards are protected before they ever sign a malicious transaction.': 'MEFAI 从不持有你的私钥。我们使用 Trust Wallet 进行登录、身份验证和执行，然后为每一步操作加上安全闸门，让 Trust Wallet 引入的同一批散户用户在签署任何恶意交易之前就受到保护。',
  'Try it live': '实时试用',
  'The pre trade safety gate': '交易前安全闸门',
  'Scan a live wallet': '扫描一个实时钱包',
  'The MEFAI wallet check': 'MEFAI 钱包检查',
  'The same wallet safety scan the terminal runs. It reads every live ERC-20 allowance a wallet has granted on BSC flags the unlimited and spam approvals that drain self custody wallets and ranks each by the USD it exposes. Real chain data. Revoke runs in the full terminal with your own connected Trust Wallet.': '与终端运行的钱包安全扫描完全相同。它读取一个钱包在 BSC 上授予的每一笔实时 ERC-20 授权，标记掏空自托管钱包的无限额和垃圾授权，并按其暴露的美元金额对每一项排序。真实链上数据。撤销操作在完整终端中通过你自己连接的 Trust Wallet 运行。',
  'The wallet is the account': '钱包即账户',
  'Wallet sign in no passwords': '钱包登录，无需密码',
  'You connect Trust Wallet and that address IS your account. No email no password no custody. Tier and history follow the wallet across devices.': '你连接 Trust Wallet，该地址就是你的账户。没有邮箱、没有密码、没有托管。等级和历史记录随钱包跨设备同步。',
  'Signature gated access': '签名门控访问',
  'Premium access is unlocked by a time windowed single use signed message. Sessions are stateless HMAC tokens so a leaked link is worthless after minutes.': '高级访问通过限时一次性签名消息解锁。会话是无状态的 HMAC 令牌，因此被泄露的链接在几分钟后即失效。',
  'Pre trade safety gate': '交易前安全闸门',
  'Before any spend the agent runs honeypot contract slippage approval preflight and MEV checks. A BLOCK verdict stops the transaction before the wallet is ever asked to sign.': '在任何花费之前，代理会运行蜜罐、合约、滑点、授权、预检和 MEV 检查。BLOCK 裁定会在钱包被要求签名之前阻止该交易。',
  'Approval drainer radar': '授权掏空雷达',
  'We surveil unlimited approval and drainer patterns so a Trust Wallet user sees the trap highlighted instead of approving it blind.': '我们监控无限额授权和掏空模式，让 Trust Wallet 用户看到被高亮标记的陷阱，而不是盲目批准。',
  'Deep link and WalletConnect': '深度链接与 WalletConnect',
  'Connect from mobile Trust Wallet over WalletConnect or jump straight into the cockpit with a deep link. The flow is built for the wallet not bolted on.': '通过 WalletConnect 从手机版 Trust Wallet 连接，或用深度链接直接进入驾驶舱。整个流程为钱包而生，而非事后拼凑。',
  'Verifiable agent identity': '可验证的代理身份',
  'The trading agent itself is a registered ERC-8004 identity on BSC so the wallet you interact with is provably the audited agent not an impostor.': '交易代理本身是在 BSC 上注册的 ERC-8004 身份，因此你交互的钱包可被证明是经审计的代理，而非冒名者。',
  'Every Trust Wallet skill catalogued': '每一项 Trust Wallet 技能尽收眼底',
  'The Agent Kit in full: the three skills and the twak command surface the agent drives. Live cards are wired into the trading loop today; available cards are kit capabilities surfaced as options. Tap any card for how it fits.': 'Agent Kit 全貌：代理驱动的三项技能与 twak 命令面。实时卡片如今已接入交易循环；可用卡片是作为选项呈现的套件能力。点按任一卡片了解其作用。',
  'See the safety gate in the protocol': '在协议中查看安全闸门',
  'Enter a valid BSC token address (0x followed by 40 hex characters).': '请输入有效的 BSC 代币地址（0x 后跟 40 个十六进制字符）。',
  'The safety gate is busy. Try again shortly.': '安全闸门繁忙，请稍后重试。',
