  "Available in the kit for time sliced accumulation. MEFAI keeps entries signal driven today so this is surfaced as an option rather than wired in.": "套件中提供用于分时累积的功能。MEFAI 目前保持入场由信号驱动,因此这里作为一个选项呈现而非接入。",
