  "The kit’s own safety check. MEFAI runs a wider six check gate before any spend and surfaces the kit probe as the matching first party path.": "套件自带的安全检查。MEFAI 在任何支出前运行更全面的六项检查闸门,并将套件探测作为对应的第一方路径呈现。",
  "Available to grant check and revoke allowances. MEFAI watches drainer patterns and surfaces approval hygiene as an available control.": "可用于授予、检查与撤销授权额度。MEFAI 监视掏空型模式,并将授权卫生作为一项可用的控制呈现。",
  "The wallet side of x402. MEFAI sells its feed over x402 and the kit lets an agent settle for it the same pattern from the buyer seat.": "x402 的钱包侧。MEFAI 通过 x402 出售其信号源,而套件让代理从买方位置以同样模式为其结算。",
  "Available for cross chain settlement. MEFAI stays on BNB Chain for the judged window so bridging is surfaced as an available capability.": "可用于跨链结算。MEFAI 在评审窗口内保持在 BNB Chain 上,因此跨链作为一项可用能力呈现。",
