  "The capability MEFAI built for this hackathon fusing the full CoinMarketCap hub and the signal engine into one conviction convening the AI council fitting the TP/SL bracket from labeled history sizing against the drawdown budget and clearing the Trust Wallet safety gate then stating one verdict. Pick an asset and every stage runs live against the audited backend.": "MEFAI 为本次黑客松构建的能力:将完整的 CoinMarketCap 枢纽与信号引擎融合为单一信念,召集 AI 委员会,从带标签的历史拟合 TP/SL 区间,在回撤预算内确定仓位,并通过 Trust Wallet 安全闸门,然后给出一个裁定。选择一个资产,每个阶段都会针对经审计的后端实时运行。",
  "The agent’s primary edge. Thousands of resolved signals with labeled outcomes feed conviction and the strongest are what the council argues over.": "代理的主要优势。数千个已结算且带标签结果的信号为信念供数据,最强的那些正是委员会争论的对象。",
  "MEFAI signals the full CMC hub and the technical reads are weighted by measured hit rate into a single conviction the agent acts on.": "MEFAI 信号、完整的 CMC 枢纽与技术读数,按实测命中率加权,合成代理据以行动的单一信念。",
