  "Conviction sets the lean but the drawdown budget caps it. Size shrinks as equity nears the floor so one bad streak cannot end the agent.": "信念决定倾向,但回撤预算为其设上限。当权益接近底线时仓位会收缩,因此一连串的失利无法终结代理。",
  "Brackets are fit from the labeled outcome history then scaled to the live regime so the R:R reflects what actually worked not a round number.": "区间从带标签的结果历史中拟合,再按实时状态缩放,使盈亏比反映真正有效的数值,而非一个整数。",
  "Every skill earns its weight from a verifiable track record. The leaderboard is what gates narrative rotation and ranks the agent’s own edges.": "每项技能都凭可验证的业绩记录赢得其权重。排行榜正是为叙事轮动设防并对代理自身优势进行排名的机制。",
  "A public notebook where each prediction is sealed as a keccak hash on BSC mainnet before entry and revealed after impossible to backfill or fake.": "一个公开的记录簿,每条预测在入场前都以 keccak 哈希封存于 BSC 主网,事后再揭示 · 无法回填或伪造。",
  "A contract enforcing a 1400 bps drawdown cap. Breach the budget and the vault halts on the mainnet registry beneath the hard floor.": "一个强制执行 1400 bps 回撤上限的合约。一旦突破预算,金库便会在主网登记上于硬底线之下停机。",
  "The result ledger records resolved signals to BSC mainnet so the track record is something a judge verifies in a block explorer not a screenshot.": "结果账本将已结算的信号记录到 BSC 主网,因此业绩记录是评委可在区块浏览器中验证的东西,而非一张截图。",
  "The agent registers an ERC-8004 identity and metadata on BSC mainnet so its actions are provably attributable to one audited entity.": "代理在 BSC 主网注册一个 ERC-8004 身份与元数据,使其行为可被证明归属于一个经审计的实体。",
  "The verified feed is served over HTTP 402 with EIP-3009 binding the exact BSC token charged so one agent pays another for proven alpha in one settlement.": "已验证的信号源通过 HTTP 402 提供,并由 EIP-3009 绑定所收取的确切 BSC 代币,因此一个代理可在一次结算中为已证明的 alpha 向另一个代理付费。",
  "The keeper records equity to the chain so the RiskGovernor always knows the real balance the drawdown cap is measured against.": "维护者将权益记录到链上,使 RiskGovernor 始终知道用以衡量回撤上限的真实余额。",
  "One conviction engine and a drawdown budget the agent cannot breach. It reads the same MEFAI signals shown below sizes each by its own payoff and writes a sealed proof before every entry. The edge is not a high hit rate. It is positive expectancy compounded under a hard risk cap, so the agent compounds while its drawdown stays structurally capped.": "一个信念引擎与一个代理无法突破的回撤预算。它读取下方所示的相同 MEFAI 信号,按各自的预期收益确定每笔仓位,并在每次入场前写入一份封存的证明。优势不在于高命中率,而在于在硬性风险上限下复利累积的正期望值,因此代理在复利增长的同时,其回撤始终在结构上被封顶。",
  "Risk is enforced not promised. A circuit breaker contract halts trading at the drawdown cap. The agent cannot exceed its own risk limit.": "风险是被强制执行的,而非承诺的。一个断路器合约会在回撤上限处停止交易。代理无法超出自身的风险上限。",
  "A contract that halts trading the instant losses approach the limit. The agent cannot exceed its own risk cap.": "一个在亏损接近上限的瞬间即停止交易的合约。代理无法超出自身的风险上限。",
  "Built so it cannot cheat and cannot exceed its risk cap": "生而无法作弊,也无法超出其风险上限",
  "A RiskGovernor contract enforces a 1400 bps drawdown cap. When equity breaches the budget the vault halts and canTrade returns false. The agent cannot exceed its own risk limit.": "一个 RiskGovernor 合约强制执行 1400 bps 的回撤上限。当权益突破预算时,金库停机且 canTrade 返回 false。代理无法超出自身的风险上限。",
