  "The gate returned GO. The unsigned route is handed to your own Trust Wallet to sign and broadcast. MEFAI never holds the key.": "La puerta devolvió GO. La ruta sin firmar se entrega a tu propia Trust Wallet para firmar y difundir. MEFAI nunca guarda la clave.",
  "The gate returned BLOCK. The transaction is stopped here and is never handed to the wallet to sign.": "La puerta devolvió BLOCK. La transacción se detiene aquí y nunca se entrega a la wallet para firmar.",
